          "kind": "svg",
          "value": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Methods Through the Bridge\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#0f172a\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"54\" fill=\"#a78bfa\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"800\">PLAN · DRAFT</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\">Methods Through the Bridge</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"136\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\">A page runs its template's Method through</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"158\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\">its Bridge. No copies, nothing to sync.</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\">5 phases · 9 actions · 3 open decisions · 3 risks</text></svg>"
